On Error Goto E
X2$=Chr$(2)+Chr$(2)+Chr$(2)+Chr$(2)+Chr$(0)+Chr$(1)+Chr$(2)+Chr$(3)+Chr$(0)
Reserve As Data 4,200 : B=Start(4)
N$="Amal    " : For I=1 To 8 : Poke B-9+I,Asc(Mid$(N$,I,1)) : Next I
Loke B,100 : Doke B+100,0
Doke B+4,2 : Doke B+6,8 : Doke B+8,28
M=B+20 : Doke M,2 : Doke M+2,15
Restore XD : For I=0 To 9 : Read V : Poke M+5+I,V : Next I
Restore YD : For I=0 To 7 : Read V : Poke M+16+I,V : Next I
M2=B+60 : Doke M2,1 : Doke M2+2,9
For I=0 To 8 : Poke M2+5+I,Asc(Mid$(X2$,I+1,1)) : Next I
Synchro Off
Channel 1 To Sprite 2 : Amal 1,"Let X=150; Let Y=80; PLay 1; Let R5=99"
Amal On 1
For I=1 To 30 : Synchro : Print #1,I;X Sprite(2);Y Sprite(2);Amreg(1,0);Amreg(1,1);Amreg(1,5);Chanmv(1) : Next I
Channel 2 To Sprite 3 : Amal 2,"Let X=50; Let Y=60; Let R0=1; PLay 1; Let R6=5"
Amal On 2
For I=1 To 4 : Synchro : Next I : Amplay 3,-1,2 To 2
For I=1 To 12 : Synchro : Print #1,I;X Sprite(3);Y Sprite(3);Amreg(2,0);Amreg(2,1);Amreg(2,6) : Next I
Channel 4 To Sprite 4 : Amal 4,"Let X=10; Let Y=20; PLay 2; Let R7=1" : Amal On 4
For I=1 To 8 : Synchro : Print #1,I;X Sprite(4);Y Sprite(4);Amreg(4,7) : Next I
Amal 3,"PLay 9; Let R1=7" : Amal On 3 : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(3,1)
Amal 3,"PLay 0; Let R1=8" : Amal On 3 : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(3,1)
Amal Off : Synchro On
Print #1,"end"
Goto FIN
XD:
Data 3,3,130,253,4,0,0,0,0,0
YD:
Data 1,2,129,1,255,1,0,0
E: Print #1,"error";Errn : Resume Next
FIN:
